 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402180/extras/4751f5a048b47edc0241f80d132c419f.avif?t=1748682973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402180/extras_big/4751f5a048b47edc0241f80d132c419f.avif?t=1748682973 width=800 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 \u200c<strong>Revolutionary Building Mechanics</strong>\u200c \u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter traditional tower defense rules! Structures can only be deployed on colored territory, while \u200c<strong>&quot;non-building cards&quot;</strong>\u200c freely occupy unobstructed areas, enabling 3D defense networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402180/extras/fa4a5945c01c974eff77b86c699916b8.avif?t=1748682973\" width=376 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 \u200c<strong>Dynamic Special Events</strong>\u200c \u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multi-layered random events \u2013 unpredictable raid types, attack coordinates, and chain reactions triggered by real-time battlefield conditions. Only adaptable strategies can overcome these crises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402180/extras/d4fac7db716bfa2f3f4c8277a8d9e284.avif?t=1748682973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402180/extras_big/d4fac7db716bfa2f3f4c8277a8d9e284.avif?t=1748682973 width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402180/extras/75faa6cdde3f51f121a57d8f4f8e5986.avif?t=1748682973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstat